stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Drafted: writing assistant or biller
  Drafted --> Checked: predictor
  Checked --> Ready: predicted pay
  Checked --> AtRisk: predicted deny
  AtRisk --> FixProposed: autofix agent (data fix)
  FixProposed --> Checked: biller approves, re-check
  AtRisk --> OnHold: process fix routed
  OnHold --> Checked: EVV fixed / new auth
  AtRisk --> WrittenOff: not fixable
  Ready --> Submitted: units reserved on auth
  Submitted --> Paid: units drawn down
  Submitted --> Denied: units released
  Denied --> Corrected: frequency code 7 + original ID
  Corrected --> Submitted
  Paid --> [*]
  WrittenOff --> [*]
